Situation-based questions
CI/CD & Deployment Scenarios
1.	Pipeline Failure Under Pressure

"A Jenkins pipeline fails during a production deployment. What steps do you take?"
They expect:
•	Log analysis (console output, stage failure)
•	Rollback strategy
•	Communication with stakeholders
•	Root cause + prevention (retry logic, alerts)
________________________________________
2.	Long Build Times

"Your Maven build suddenly takes 3x longer. How do you troubleshoot?"
Focus on:
•	Dependency issues / Nexus slowness
•	Resource bottlenecks (CPU/memory)
•	Parallel builds, caching
•	Recent changes in pipeline
________________________________________
3.	Broken GitHub Actions Workflow

"A GitHub Actions pipeline works locally but fails in CI. Why?"
Common angles:
•	Environment differences
•	Missing secrets/env variables
•	Permissions (IAM, tokens)
•	Dependency versions
